  enforceable under applicable law;
* publication, distribution, transmission, sublicensing, sale, rental,
  lending, hosting, deployment, or making available;
* creation of derivative works;
* incorporation into any other work, product, service, repository,
  dataset, educational material, training data, machine-learning
  dataset, generative-AI dataset, benchmark, evaluation suite, asset
  library, code library, template collection, or documentation corpus;
* use in a manner that treats the Original Materials, or any
  substantially derived work, as a third party's own work;
* use that obscures, weakens, or misrepresents the source, authorship,
  provenance, copyright status, licensing status, all-rights-reserved
  status, or non-open-source status of the Original Materials;
* use of the Original Materials to create, improve, train, fine-tune,
  evaluate, benchmark, validate, test, or populate any artificial
  intelligence system, machine-learning model, generative model, code
  model, multimodal model, search index, retrieval system, dataset, or
  synthetic data generation pipeline;
* extraction, reuse, recoloring, remapping, redistribution, repackaging,
  or incorporation of project-specific textures, branding material,
  application icons, user interface assets, shaders, bundled resources,
