model outputs that substantially reproduce protected material, indexes,
embeddings, and other reproductions under the violator's possession or
control, except to the extent retention is strictly required by
applicable law.

Termination does not limit any rights or remedies available to Kento
Konishi under copyright law, contract law, unfair competition law,
trademark law, database law, trade secret law, platform terms, or any
other applicable law.

