14. Versioning, Effective Dates, and Revision History

This license version is identified as Version 1.0.3.

The Original Effective Date of this independent license is 2026-06-03.
The Current Version Effective Date of Version 1.0.3 is 2026-06-10.

Revision history:

* Version 1.0.0, effective 2026-06-03:
  Initial independent viewing-only license for the Original Materials.

* Version 1.0.1, effective 2026-06-04:
  Clarifies that third-party legal material is organized under
  third-party/ and that local app-managed runtime data and application
  output remain outside the Original Materials except where they include
  protected repository content.

* Version 1.0.2, effective 2026-06-10:
  Strengthens the repository viewing limitation, ordinary application
  use limitation, prohibited conduct provisions, AI and dataset use
  restrictions, bundled resource and distribution material treatment,
  provenance-sensitive material treatment, controlling-text rule,
  termination consequences, severability, and non-waiver provisions.

* Version 1.0.3, effective 2026-06-10:
  Adds an express Japanese governing-law clause, an exclusive
  first-instance forum clause for the Tokyo District Court to the extent
  permitted by law, and a platform-terms clarification stating that
  GitHub service functionality does not expand the independent license
  for the Original Materials beyond this license.
